# Archive build outputs
cmd/archive/*/import-blockchain
cmd/archive/*/netrunner
cmd/archive/*/rpc-server
cmd/archive/*/verify-chain
cmd/archive/*/check-balance
migrated-ethdb.disabled/
*.mem
*.sst
# the compiled binary, not cmd/bootstrap-chain/ — an unanchored pattern here
# silently swallows the source directory and every new file added to it
/bootstrap-chain

# live/ holds the artifacts that reproduce a RUNNING network — the only copies
# of some of them. The blanket *.json above silently excluded live/mainnet/
# genesis.json on its first commit while git reported success, so this negation
# is not tidiness: without it the one document that reproduces mainnet is
# untracked and no error says so.
!live/**
